\begin{tabular}{ll}
\toprule
Claim & Status \\
\midrule
The $+0.0226$ rebound is noise & step $\le$ spread $0.082$ (Thm.~\ref{thm:noise}) \\
The cumulative $0.1375$ decline is signal & exceeds spread (Thm.~\ref{thm:twospread}) \\
The $-0.0483$ step is not a pooling artefact & inside $[1,1.21]$ (Thm.~\ref{thm:notartefact}) \\
